                 sshhooww ppaanniicc
                       Prints the panic string.

                 sshhooww ppooooll [//pp] _a_d_d_r
                       Prints the pool at _a_d_d_r.  Valid modifiers:
                       //pp   Print the pagelist for this pool.

                 sshhooww pprroocc [//tt] [_a_d_d_r]
                       Prints the _s_t_r_u_c_t _p_r_o_c at _a_d_d_r.  If an optional address
