                 sshhooww uuvvmmeexxpp
                       Displays a selection of uvm counters and statistics.

                 sshhooww vvnnooddee [//ff] _a_d_d_r
                       Prints the _s_t_r_u_c_t _v_n_o_d_e at _a_d_d_r.  If the //ff modifier is
                       specified, prints out all bufs (see also sshhooww bbuuff) cur‐
                       rently attached to this vnode.

                 sshhooww wwaattcchheess
                       Displays all watchpoints set with the wwaattcchh command.

                 sshhooww wwiittnneessss [//bb]
                       Prints the current order list.  If the //bb modifier is
                       specified, the list of found lock order violations is
                       printed instead.  The ooppttiioonn WWIITTNNEESSSS is required for
